<title>UK: Merck sets 200 mln Swiss franc 6-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Merck sets 200 mln Swiss franc 6-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERCK KGAA, DARMSTADT</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    29.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   EOS	   07.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
